# --- Chat demo (component showcase) -----------------------------------------
# Both are optional: with neither set, the chat falls back to its hand-written
# replies and everything still works.

# Preferred. Serverless proxy that keeps the key server-side (see api/chat.ts).
# VITE_CHAT_ENDPOINT=/api/chat

# Local convenience only. Vite inlines this into the bundle, so it is PUBLIC as
# soon as the site is deployed. Never use an unrestricted key here.
# VITE_GEMINI_API_KEY=

# Read by api/chat.ts on the server. No VITE_ prefix: never sent to the browser.
# Set this one in the Vercel project settings, not in a committed file.
# GEMINI_API_KEY=
